@@ -0,0 +1,160 @@
+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+"""
+***************************************************************************
+*   Copyright (c) 2013, 2014, 2015                                        *
+*   Original code by:                                                     *
+*   Ulrich Brammer <ulrich1a[at]users.sourceforge.net>                    *
