@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@
+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+"""
+***************************************************************************
+*   Copyright (c) 2024                                                    *
+*   Original code by:                                                     *
+*   Alex Neufeld <alex.d.neufeld@gmail.com>                               *
+*                                                                         *
